#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/contributing/remote_tools.rst:4
#: 28bce83ca0bb477a9eafce146b01a015
msgid ""
"This guide covers how to contribute remote tools to the ToolUniverse "
"repository. Remote tools run on separate servers and are accessed via MCP"
" (Model Context Protocol) or REST APIs."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍了如何向 ToolUniverse 仓库贡献远程工具。远程工具运行在独立的服务器上，并通过 MCP（模型上下文协议）或 REST API"
" 进行访问。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/contributing/remote_tools.rst:7
#: 7c0f2652208441fb9ca2cf662cd0e91f
msgid ""
"**Key Difference**: Remote tools don't require modifying ``__init__.py``,"
" but you must provide a publicly accessible server or detailed deployment"
" instructions."
msgstr "**关键区别**：远程工具无需修改``__init__.py``，但您必须提供一个可公开访问的服务器或详细的部署说明。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/contributing/remote_tools.rst:10
#: e9d8576a1bca4994b0fb72748ffb042b
msgid "Quick Overview"
msgstr "快速概览"

